Description: instant replay for Linux gaming
 Momento records the screen and sound in the background all the time. One
 hotkey (Super+Shift+G) saves what just happened, from the last 15 seconds
 up to the full hour, to your Videos folder. Encoding runs on the GPU through
 VA-API or NVENC, and clips are cut without re-encoding.
 .
 Enable the recorder per user with: systemctl --user enable --now momento
